# The build context is the source tree and nothing else. `.git` is excluded
# deliberately: the commit reaches the binary through --build-arg COMMIT, not
# through a VCS stamp, so shipping the history into the build would only make
# the context larger and the layer cache more brittle.
.git
.github
.claude
.devbox
bin/
dist/
data/
docs/
plans/
testdata/
*.env
*.local
